<title>USA: FONAR distribution deal yields first sale.</title>
<headline>FONAR distribution deal yields first sale.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnetic resonance imaging scanner maker Fonar Corp said Tuesday the recent sale of one of its QUAD series MRI scanners is the first by National Imaging Resources through their distribution agreement.</p>
<p>FONAR said the agreement calls for NIR dealers to sell a minimum of 30 units in the first 12 months of the agreement, which would result in an estimated $40 million in revenues for Fonar.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
